WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.072 --> 00:00:01.764
(upbeat music)

00:00:01.764 --> 00:00:03.645
- In my expert medical opinion,

00:00:03.645 --> 00:00:04.753
you gotta get a standing desk.

00:00:04.753 --> 00:00:07.470
- Well you're an orthodontist,
so if I need braces

00:00:07.470 --> 00:00:09.559
I'll ask for your expert medical opinion.

00:00:09.559 --> 00:00:11.168
- Well then I'll recommend a back brace.

00:00:11.168 --> 00:00:12.757
- No I don't want a back brace.

00:00:12.757 --> 00:00:14.533
- Tough, it's either
prescription already out.

00:00:14.533 --> 00:00:15.557
- Please.

00:00:15.557 --> 00:00:18.441
(kisses)

00:00:18.441 --> 00:00:19.319
- You're convincing.

00:00:19.319 --> 00:00:22.986
- (laughs) I don't want it.

00:00:26.633 --> 00:00:28.597
- Don't, don't.

00:00:28.597 --> 00:00:29.475
- Sorry.

00:00:29.475 --> 00:00:30.750
(moans)

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:32.250
I'll just read it.

00:00:33.153 --> 00:00:34.177
Uh-oh.

00:00:34.177 --> 00:00:35.870
- I know you're not going
to the office right now.

00:00:35.870 --> 00:00:37.249
- I just have to grab a hard drive

00:00:37.249 --> 00:00:39.109
and answer a few e-mails.

00:00:39.109 --> 00:00:41.241
- If you keep working
100 hour weeks like this

00:00:41.241 --> 00:00:42.515
you're gonna flame out.

00:00:42.515 --> 00:00:43.623
Or throw out your back.

00:00:43.623 --> 00:00:45.796
- On my way back into
the office as we speak

00:00:45.796 --> 00:00:47.008
I'll get it done right away.

00:00:47.008 --> 00:00:48.743
I seem to remember you
working all the time

00:00:48.743 --> 00:00:49.767
when you had your residency.

00:00:49.767 --> 00:00:51.418
- [Derek] Yeah but that
had a defined end time.

00:00:51.418 --> 00:00:53.445
- [Anne] So does this, I
just gotta put my time,

00:00:53.445 --> 00:00:54.887
pay my dues and not piss anyone off.

00:00:54.887 --> 00:00:56.684
- [Derek] You work twice as
hard as anyone else there.

00:00:56.684 --> 00:00:57.666
- [Anne] Yeah because I'm the only analyst

00:00:57.666 --> 00:00:59.568
without an MBA I spend half my time

00:00:59.568 --> 00:01:01.324
just fixing my own mistakes.

00:01:01.324 --> 00:01:02.557
- [Derek] Stop putting yourself down,

00:01:02.557 --> 00:01:03.685
you're the only one there with out an MBA

00:01:03.685 --> 00:01:05.858
because you're the only
one who doesn't need one.

00:01:05.858 --> 00:01:07.551
- You stay past midnight, take an Uber,

00:01:07.551 --> 00:01:09.077
we don't want you falling
asleep behind the wheel, okay?

00:01:09.077 --> 00:01:10.519
- Okay, I'm almost done.

00:01:10.519 --> 00:01:12.936
(soft music)

00:01:17.687 --> 00:01:19.923
Why are you throwing like this?

00:01:19.923 --> 00:01:21.239
- It's late, I'm gonna go to bed.

00:01:21.239 --> 00:01:22.263
- Okay.

00:01:22.263 --> 00:01:23.956
- [Derek] Don't stay up too late working.

00:01:23.956 --> 00:01:26.039
- [Anne] I'm almost done.

00:01:39.880 --> 00:01:41.880
(drops)

00:02:04.561 --> 00:02:06.978
(soft music)

00:02:13.735 --> 00:02:14.568
- Anne?

00:02:16.138 --> 00:02:18.813
Just wanted to shout out Anne's hard work,

00:02:18.813 --> 00:02:20.945
in wrapping up the
Millstone Tires account.

00:02:20.945 --> 00:02:21.885
(chuckles)

00:02:21.885 --> 00:02:23.829
- [Friend] Well do you
want to marry him or not?

00:02:23.829 --> 00:02:24.999
- In theory.

00:02:24.999 --> 00:02:27.360
You know a few years from now
when my career is worked out

00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:29.680
and I'm worth millions of dollars.

00:02:29.680 --> 00:02:31.519
- So retirement?

00:02:31.519 --> 00:02:32.352
Basically.

00:02:33.693 --> 00:02:34.776
- I love him.

00:02:37.209 --> 00:02:38.395
But.
- So what's the problem?

00:02:38.395 --> 00:02:39.607
- We haven't even talked about it.

00:02:39.607 --> 00:02:41.153
- Well people typically
don't talk about engagements,

00:02:41.153 --> 00:02:42.052
it's a surprise.

00:02:42.052 --> 00:02:44.852
- The ring is a surprise,
the marriage you talk about.

00:02:44.852 --> 00:02:46.649
- Okay, yeah.

00:02:46.649 --> 00:02:48.091
- I'll be home in two hours.

00:02:48.091 --> 00:02:49.366
Three tops.

00:02:49.366 --> 00:02:50.244
- Okay.

00:02:50.244 --> 00:02:52.793
- I promise to be home before breakfast.

00:02:52.793 --> 00:02:54.298
- Dinner will be in the fridge.

00:02:54.298 --> 00:02:56.798
- Okay, thank you, I love you.

00:02:58.833 --> 00:03:00.233
(clatters)

00:03:00.233 --> 00:03:01.681
- Oh fuck.

00:03:01.681 --> 00:03:02.514
Fuck.

00:03:04.789 --> 00:03:07.234
You said you weren't gonna
be working 100 hour weeks

00:03:07.234 --> 00:03:08.906
once Millstone was over.

00:03:08.906 --> 00:03:11.643
Millstone is done, and it's one AM.

00:03:11.643 --> 00:03:13.566
- This was a fluke okay, Paul was out sick

00:03:13.566 --> 00:03:14.799
and I had to cover for him.

00:03:14.799 --> 00:03:16.032
- It's bullshit.

00:03:16.032 --> 00:03:18.581
I still barely see you and
when I do you're distracted

00:03:18.581 --> 00:03:21.361
and a nervous wreck unless
you're at inbox zero.

00:03:21.361 --> 00:03:23.012
You are seeking out work for no reason

00:03:23.012 --> 00:03:26.126
and seeing you miserable
is making me miserable.

00:03:26.126 --> 00:03:27.505
- Oh you liked it better
when I was sitting

00:03:27.505 --> 00:03:28.780
at home unemployed?

00:03:28.780 --> 00:03:30.848
When I was just spending
my time surfing LinkedIn

00:03:30.848 --> 00:03:32.437
and stress cleaning the fridge,

00:03:32.437 --> 00:03:34.171
is that the me that you like?

00:03:34.171 --> 00:03:36.010
- Why does it have to be one or the other?

00:03:36.010 --> 00:03:37.870
- Because half of the
reason I have this job

00:03:37.870 --> 00:03:39.417
is my work ethic.

00:03:39.417 --> 00:03:41.256
I'm not as smart as these people okay,

00:03:41.256 --> 00:03:42.656
I have to work harder.

00:03:42.656 --> 00:03:45.498
- You've got to stop shitting
on yourself all the time.

00:03:45.498 --> 00:03:46.898
Why do you do that?

00:03:46.898 --> 00:03:49.406
(exhales)

00:03:49.406 --> 00:03:50.304
- You don't get it.

00:03:50.304 --> 00:03:53.356
- No I don't, I wish I did but I don't.

00:03:53.356 --> 00:03:54.773
I'm going to bed.

00:04:03.805 --> 00:04:05.664
- Oh my daughter got it for me.

00:04:05.664 --> 00:04:07.629
- (laughs) Spooky.

00:04:07.629 --> 00:04:09.405
- Anyway I wanted to talk to you

00:04:09.405 --> 00:04:11.265
about Marshall Spencer leaving.

00:04:11.265 --> 00:04:12.585
You heard he's leaving right?

00:04:12.585 --> 00:04:13.418
- Now I,

00:04:13.418 --> 00:04:15.654
- Yeah well it means we're gonna have

00:04:15.654 --> 00:04:17.994
an associate position open and depending

00:04:17.994 --> 00:04:21.150
on how you handle Tanaka in
the next couple of weeks,

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:23.198
we just wanted to see
if you were interested.

00:04:23.198 --> 00:04:25.058
- Oh, absolutely.

00:04:25.058 --> 00:04:27.808
- [Boss] Great, I'll let HR know.

00:04:34.065 --> 00:04:38.232
- What if we threw like a joint
Halloween/Anniversary party?

00:04:39.206 --> 00:04:41.630
I would do everything okay,
I would make the invites,

00:04:41.630 --> 00:04:45.797
I'd buy us couples costumes,
I'll do the decorations.

00:04:46.729 --> 00:04:48.881
- You have to promise me
you're gonna cut back.

00:04:48.881 --> 00:04:49.714
- Okay.

00:04:52.371 --> 00:04:54.148
- No work emails.

00:04:54.148 --> 00:04:56.065
- [Anne] No work emails

00:04:57.638 --> 00:05:01.337
did you like your shoulder
kiss, did you like it?

00:05:01.337 --> 00:05:02.758
- I didn't even feel it.

00:05:02.758 --> 00:05:04.806
(kisses)

00:05:04.806 --> 00:05:05.955
Nope didn't even feel it.

00:05:05.955 --> 00:05:07.000
- You felt that, you felt it.

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:08.442
- I didn't feel it.

00:05:08.442 --> 00:05:10.859
(mood music)

00:05:28.441 --> 00:05:31.024
(upbeat music)

00:05:46.706 --> 00:05:48.706
(types)

00:05:56.695 --> 00:05:57.761
Hey there beautiful.

00:05:57.761 --> 00:05:58.594
- Hi.

00:05:59.558 --> 00:06:02.058
(jazzy music)

00:06:08.252 --> 00:06:09.171
HI.

00:06:09.171 --> 00:06:11.178
- [Guest] Oh my god the place looks great.

00:06:11.178 --> 00:06:12.055
(chatter)

00:06:12.055 --> 00:06:16.222
- We have drinks and candy
and also just a good time.

00:06:17.531 --> 00:06:18.429
- Oh.

00:06:18.429 --> 00:06:19.328
- Oh.

00:06:19.328 --> 00:06:21.411
(shouts)

00:06:30.153 --> 00:06:31.637
- With another round of antibiotics,

00:06:31.637 --> 00:06:33.810
you might be ready for a replacement.

00:06:33.810 --> 00:06:34.730
- Hey how's Tanaka?

00:06:34.730 --> 00:06:36.861
- Oh, it's good.

00:06:36.861 --> 00:06:38.303
Why did you hear anything?

00:06:38.303 --> 00:06:39.390
- Uh,

00:06:39.390 --> 00:06:42.462
no I was just making conversation.

00:06:42.462 --> 00:06:43.987
- Oh cool.

00:06:43.987 --> 00:06:45.154
I have to pee.

00:06:55.899 --> 00:06:58.566
(pulsing music)

00:07:03.167 --> 00:07:05.136
- Hey have you seen Anne anywhere?

00:07:05.136 --> 00:07:06.724
- Uh no sorry man.

00:07:06.724 --> 00:07:07.557
- Alright.

00:07:10.549 --> 00:07:12.931
(whispers)

00:07:12.931 --> 00:07:14.373
- Guys?

00:07:14.373 --> 00:07:15.373
- Hey, Anne.

00:07:16.317 --> 00:07:17.759
What the fuck are you doing in here?

00:07:17.759 --> 00:07:19.556
- I just had to answer some emails.

00:07:19.556 --> 00:07:21.855
- Okay well we just came in here to talk,

00:07:21.855 --> 00:07:23.505
we'll talk outside.

00:07:23.505 --> 00:07:24.404
- Whatever.

00:07:24.404 --> 00:07:27.320
- Goodnight Anne.
- Come on John.

00:07:27.320 --> 00:07:29.487
(chatter)

00:07:31.656 --> 00:07:33.367
- Have you seen Anne?

00:07:33.367 --> 00:07:35.867
- I think she was in the shed.

00:07:36.713 --> 00:07:37.880
- Okay thanks.

00:07:51.467 --> 00:07:52.300
Anne?

00:07:56.420 --> 00:07:57.360
- No, come on.

00:07:57.360 --> 00:07:58.259
Derek.

00:07:58.259 --> 00:07:59.617
This is so stupid, just give it to me.

00:07:59.617 --> 00:08:00.767
- Anne, it's not I said you,

00:08:00.767 --> 00:08:01.916
- Just give it.

00:08:01.916 --> 00:08:02.749
- Fuck.

00:08:04.298 --> 00:08:05.131
Is it okay?

00:08:05.131 --> 00:08:07.579
- [Anne] It's not okay.

00:08:07.579 --> 00:08:08.412
- Anne.

00:08:10.212 --> 00:08:12.428
(exhales)

00:08:12.428 --> 00:08:13.974
- It won't turn on.

00:08:13.974 --> 00:08:16.356
- Anne I'm sorry about
dropping your laptop.

00:08:16.356 --> 00:08:17.631
But can we not let this
overshadow the fact

00:08:17.631 --> 00:08:20.473
that I just found you working
in secret in the shed.

00:08:20.473 --> 00:08:24.674
- Okay fine, I went to the
shed, I answered a couple emails

00:08:24.674 --> 00:08:26.889
that would have taken me five minutes.

00:08:26.889 --> 00:08:28.017
I have to hide everything from you.

00:08:28.017 --> 00:08:28.916
- Fucking check with me.

00:08:28.916 --> 00:08:30.651
- So you can make me feel guilty?

00:08:30.651 --> 00:08:32.824
Do I need to check with
you now to do simple tasks?

00:08:32.824 --> 00:08:34.266
- Anne that just shows me
that you don't actually care

00:08:34.266 --> 00:08:36.168
about changing, you don't
think this is a problem.

00:08:36.168 --> 00:08:37.045
You're just trying to get away with it.

00:08:37.045 --> 00:08:39.177
- It's not a problem, I'm
cutting it back for you.

00:08:39.177 --> 00:08:41.685
- You've got 50 friends outside
wondering where you are.

00:08:41.685 --> 00:08:43.837
Is this really the kind
of person you want to be?

00:08:43.837 --> 00:08:44.778
An email junky?

00:08:44.778 --> 00:08:46.679
- Email junky?

00:08:46.679 --> 00:08:48.414
I'm not outside doing crack okay,

00:08:48.414 --> 00:08:50.023
you don't have to treat me
like an after school special.

00:08:50.023 --> 00:08:52.196
- All I'm trying to do
is get you to own up.

00:08:52.196 --> 00:08:55.415
- I did, I was working you caught me,

00:08:55.415 --> 00:08:58.173
how long you gonna relish in this victory?

00:08:58.173 --> 00:09:00.179
- Why would I relish in this?

00:09:00.179 --> 00:09:01.977
Why, I'm not trying to
score points with you Anne,

00:09:01.977 --> 00:09:02.959
I'm trying to help you.

00:09:02.959 --> 00:09:06.010
- If you want to help me give
me space and let me do my job.

00:09:06.010 --> 00:09:07.661
- You got it, okay, I'm
gonna give you space.

00:09:07.661 --> 00:09:11.828
- I don't need you to swoop
in here with your engagement.

00:09:17.128 --> 00:09:19.907
- What were you gonna say?

00:09:19.907 --> 00:09:21.725
You found the ring?

00:09:21.725 --> 00:09:22.558
- Mm-hmm.

00:09:23.418 --> 00:09:25.918
- Why didn't you say anything?

00:09:26.929 --> 00:09:28.789
- Found it six weeks ago.

00:09:28.789 --> 00:09:32.622
We've never even talked
about getting married.

00:09:36.103 --> 00:09:37.023
- I know.

00:09:37.023 --> 00:09:37.856
Hey I'm,

00:09:42.393 --> 00:09:44.726
I returned it two weeks ago.

00:09:46.092 --> 00:09:46.925
- What?

00:09:49.206 --> 00:09:51.039
Why would you do that?

00:09:54.305 --> 00:09:57.147
- Because I didn't think you'd say yes.

00:09:57.147 --> 00:09:57.980
And

00:10:00.010 --> 00:10:03.843
I also didn't know if I
wanted you to anymore.

00:10:14.346 --> 00:10:17.774
- Then why are we having
a Halloween party?

00:10:17.774 --> 00:10:19.529
- I was trying not to
have this conversation

00:10:19.529 --> 00:10:21.389
so close to our anniversary.

00:10:21.389 --> 00:10:24.556
- (laughs) Oh my god.

00:10:25.464 --> 00:10:26.631
Such an idiot.

00:10:28.996 --> 00:10:31.712
You've just been phoning
it in for a few weeks

00:10:31.712 --> 00:10:34.220
and you think I'm the one who lies.

00:10:34.220 --> 00:10:37.041
I need you to get out of here.

00:10:37.041 --> 00:10:37.874
Please.

00:10:40.657 --> 00:10:44.502
- Anne, outside of me,
you need to see somebody

00:10:44.502 --> 00:10:45.840
about this okay?

00:10:45.840 --> 00:10:46.759
Like a professional.

00:10:46.759 --> 00:10:48.932
- Okay, thank you.

00:10:48.932 --> 00:10:50.583
- 'Cause I've been trying and I can't.

00:10:50.583 --> 00:10:53.467
- Okay, that's fine, please leave.

00:10:53.467 --> 00:10:54.634
Get out Derek.

00:11:07.176 --> 00:11:09.176
(cries)

00:11:10.541 --> 00:11:11.708
Just a second.

00:11:12.631 --> 00:11:15.306
- [Neighbor] Hi sorry, I live next door.

00:11:15.306 --> 00:11:16.685
- [Anne] Can you give me a minute?

00:11:16.685 --> 00:11:18.127
- [Neighbor] Yeah sorry to bother you,

00:11:18.127 --> 00:11:20.154
we can hear your music.

00:11:20.154 --> 00:11:21.909
- [Anne] Not right now okay?

00:11:21.909 --> 00:11:23.769
- [Neighbor] Okay but could
you turn the music down?

00:11:23.769 --> 00:11:24.647
- [Anne] Get out okay?

00:11:24.647 --> 00:11:26.402
- Okay, yeah, yeah okay, I
have a big test tomorrow.

00:11:26.402 --> 00:11:27.531
- [Anne] Get out!

00:11:27.531 --> 00:11:28.364
- Okay.

00:11:28.364 --> 00:11:30.781
(shuts door)

00:11:32.341 --> 00:11:34.758
(soft music)

00:11:43.710 --> 00:11:45.710
(types)

00:11:59.634 --> 00:12:01.634
(sighs)

00:12:02.859 --> 00:12:03.692
- Oh no.

00:12:08.919 --> 00:12:09.752
Great.

00:12:15.501 --> 00:12:16.567
(moans)

00:12:16.567 --> 00:12:17.400
Fuck.

00:12:21.833 --> 00:12:22.666
Help!

00:12:24.508 --> 00:12:25.341
Anyone?

